      "widgets_values": [
        "OTR LTX-only smoke -- pre-baked upstream artifacts\n\nBuilt 2026-05-02 by Sprint 3 mega-sprint hot-fix session.\nBypasses the 50-min LLM/audio/FLUX/HuMo cascade by feeding the\nLTX render the ledger from the prior failed-at-LTX run, plus\nthe procgen mp4 + 4 HuMo character clips that survived (l002,\nl003, l004, l005) under output\\otr\\videos\\<episode_id>\\.\n\nWallclock estimate: ~10 min. Full pipeline ~60 min.\n\nEpisode_id: signal_lost_boosting_one_protein_helps_the_brain_fig_20260502_170555\nLedger:    C:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\output\\otr\\audio\\signal_lost_boosting_one_protein_helps_the_brain_fig_20260502_170555_ledger.json\nProcgen:   C:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\output\\otr\\audio\\signal_lost_boosting_one_protein_helps_the_brain_fig_20260502_170555.mp4\n\nTo use against a different episode: swap the LEDGER_PATH +\nPROCGEN_MP4 widget values on nodes 2 + 3. Both must come from\nthe same episode_id so LTX writes into the dir HuMo wrote into."
      ],
